      "side": 1,
      "message": "What about having `kTexture` be marked with SkUNREACHABLE and remove the `default` case entirely. The compiler will then warn about additional types that are added later?\n\nAlthough I suppose we aren\u0027t handling the uniform buffer type right now, but IIUC, its use case fits very closely with the kTexture being populated externally, right?",
